@url=http://localhost:5000

### Agent card
GET {{url}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### A2A - cat weight
POST {{url}}/cat-weight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "test-1",
  "method": "SendMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "test-message-1",
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "I have 3 leopards and 5 European cats. How many of them can fit in a vehicle with a 100 kg payload capacity?"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}